\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Controller-aware robustness workflow. The certificate turns weak-node and weak-link analysis into a typed engineering statement: the element is weak for a specified mode, action, and controller configuration.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
